  "decision": "Candidate discarded. The apparent 40ns retransmit16 delta was one OS timer quantum with sample_size1. At100 iterations/sample the retained production version is about1\u20132% above main, and the candidate changes that case by less than1% without consistently improving every pair. No production change is justified by this experiment. Retained original3056 binary restored and SHA-verified against v15 metadata. The ordinary ACK fix3056 remains and its much larger prior regression is independently established.\n",
